<title>USA: Interactive Flight to make placement in 97.</title>
<headline>Interactive Flight to make placement in 97.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interactive Flight Technologies Inc said Monday it will work with BT Securities Corp on an offering of up to $150 million in debt and equity securities.</p>
<p>The placement should be in the first quarter of 1997 if all conditions are met, the company said.</p>
<p>Interactive Flight makes digital games, shopping and video on demand for inflight entertainment on aircraft.</p>
